,"gloss":"and to reach"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"மாலை","parts":[{"text":"மாலை","lemma":"mālai","gloss":"evening"}],"gloss":"evening"},{"surface":"வந்தன்று","parts":[{"text":"வந்து","lemma":"vā","gloss":"come"},{"text":"அன்று","lemma":"aṉṟu","gloss":"singular neuter past suffix"}],"gloss":"has arrived"},{"surface":"மாரி","parts":[{"text":"மாரி","lemma":"māri","gloss":"rain"}],"gloss":"rain"},{"surface":"மாமழை","parts":[{"text":"மா","lemma":"mā","gloss":"great"},{"text":"மழை","lemma":"maḻai","gloss":"rain/cloud"}],"gloss":"great rain clouds"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பொன்னேர்","parts":[{"text":"பொன்","lemma":"poṉ","gloss":"gold"},{"text":"நேர்","lemma":"nēr","gloss":"resembling"}],"gloss":"gold-resembling"},{"surface":"மேனி","parts":[{"text":"மேனி","lemma":"mēṉi","gloss":"body/complexion"}],"gloss":"body"},{"surface":"நன்னலம்","parts":[{"text":"நல்","lemma":"nal","gloss":"good"},{"text":"நலம்","lemma":"nalam","gloss":"beauty"}],"gloss":"good beauty"},{"surface":"சிதைத்தோர்","parts":[{"text":"சிதைத்தோர்","lemma":"citai","gloss":"he who ruined"}],"gloss":"he who ruined"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"இன்னும்","parts":[{"text":"இன்னும்","lemma":"iṉṉum","gloss":"still"}],"gloss":"still"},{"surface":"வாரார்","parts":[{"text":"வாரார்","lemma":"vā","gloss":"he does not come"}],"gloss":"he does not return"},{"surface":"ஆயின்","parts":[{"text":"ஆயின்","lemma":"āyiṉ","gloss":"if"}],"gloss":"if"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"என்னாந்","parts":[{"text":"என்னாந்","lemma":"என்னாந்","gloss":"what will become of"}],"gloss":"what will become of","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"தோழி","parts":[{"text":"தோழி","lemma":"tōḻi","gloss":"friend"}],"gloss":"O friend"},{"surface":"நம்","parts":[{"text":"நம்","lemma":"nam","gloss":"our"}],"gloss":"our"},{"surface":"இன்னுயிர்","parts":[{"text":"இன்","lemma":"iṉ","gloss":"sweet"},{"text":"உயிர்","lemma":"uyir","gloss":"life"}],"gloss":"sweet life"},{"surface":"நிலையே","parts":[{"text":"நிலை","lemma":"nilai","gloss":"state"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"the state indeed"}]}],"literal":"The male deer, embracing the gentle female deer, with intense desire, / and hiding to huddle in the bushes of the forest, / the good male elephant with a trunk, joining with the female elephant, / and reaching the mountain interior on the dark-adorned slopes, / evening has arrived, along with the rainy season's great clouds; / he who ruined the good beauty of my gold-like complexion, / if he still does not return, / O friend, what will become of the state of our sweet life?","translation":"The stag, embracing his gentle mate with deep desire, hides and huddles in the forest bushes. The great tusker with his trunk, united with his female elephant, retreats to the dark-sloped mountain clefts. Evening has arrived, bringing the heavy rains of the season. If he who ruined the fine beauty of my gold-like complexion still does not return, O friend, what will become of my sweet life?","modern":"ஆண் மான் தன் மென்மையான பெண் மானைத் தழுவிக்கொண்டு, மிகுந்த காதலுடன் காட்டில் உள்ள புதர்களில் மறைந்து ஒடுங்கவும், தும்பிக்கையையுடைய நல்ல ஆண் யானை தன் பெண் யானையோடு கூடி, மேகங்கள் சூழ்ந்த பக்க மலைகளின் உட்பகுதிக்குச் செல்லவும், மழைக்காலத்து மேகங்களுடன் மாலைப் பொழுது வந்துவிட்டது. பொன்னைப் போன்ற என் உடலின் அழகைச் சிதைத்தவர் இன்னும் திரும்பி வரவில்லை என்றால், தோழியே! நம்முடைய இனிய உயிரின் நிலை என்னவாகும்?","explanation":"The heroine is speaking to her close friend in a state of deep distress. The rainy season and evening have arrived, which is the time the hero promised to return from his journey. She observes that the animals in nature, such as the deer and the elephants, are pairing up and seeking shelter together to escape the rain and darkness. This imagery of union in the natural world contrasts sharply with her own loneliness and heightens her grief. Since the hero has not yet returned, she despairs over whether she can survive this separation. The poem beautifully employs the mullai landscape elements of evening, rain, and the theme of patient waiting.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}